Transom for Linux includes the FFmpeg libraries libavcodec, libavformat,
libavutil, libswresample and libswscale, unmodified, from
@FFMPEG_NAME@ (BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds release @FFMPEG_TAG@,
https://ffmpeg.org).

They are licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License version 3
or later; see FFmpeg-LICENSE.txt.

Source: https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds/releases/tag/@FFMPEG_TAG@
and https://ffmpeg.org/download.html.

The libraries are in /usr/lib/transom (the .deb) or usr/lib/transom
inside the AppImage, and can be replaced with compatible builds of the
same versions.
